    "created_at": "2016-04-10T16:08:16Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-04-10T16:08:16Z",
    "body": "It's not in the dictionary: http://www.merriam-webster.com/dictionary/suggestions/user%20agent.\nAlso, a [bunch](http://w3c.github.io/permissions/#dfn-user-agent) [of](https://w3c.github.io/uievents/#user-agent) [higher-level](https://drafts.csswg.org/css-speech-1/#user-agent) [specs](https://drafts.csswg.org/css-backgrounds-3/#user-agent) define it, and I'd like to centralize that.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
