    "created_at": "2016-04-10T18:59:55Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-04-10T18:59:55Z",
    "body": "I think HTML is probably the best place we're going to get, at least for now. Especially for user agent, it seems like a good place, since so much of user agent behavior (navigation etc.) is defined in HTML.\n\nWe'll probably want to wait on solving this until #1012 lands since there'd be a lot of conflicts in adding the appropriate xrefs.\n",
